# <%= gem_name %>

RubyLLM provider gem for <%= class_name %>.

## Installation

Add this line to your application's Gemfile:

```ruby
gem '<%= gem_name %>'
```

Then configure the provider:

```ruby
require '<%= require_path %>'

RubyLLM.configure do |config|
  config.<%= api_key_config %> = ENV['<%= api_key_env %>']
  config.<%= api_base_config %> = ENV.fetch('<%= api_base_env %>', '<%= api_base %>')
end
```

## Usage

```ruby
chat = RubyLLM.chat(model: '<%= model %>', provider: :<%= slug %>)
response = chat.ask('Hello')
puts response.content
```

## Development

```sh
bin/setup
bundle exec rake
RUN_PROVIDER_INTEGRATION=true bundle exec rspec spec/ruby_llm/chat_spec.rb
```

Live specs are skipped unless `RUN_PROVIDER_INTEGRATION=true`.
